      "statement": "make-secrets.sh idempotently creates eight secret files in a mode-700 directory: four random values, the deploy key copied from its second argument (or empty for file:// catalogs), database_url assembled from hc_db_password, and empty otlp_headers and ldap_bind_pw placeholders; existing files are never overwritten.",
